Scope

This license covers the source code in this repository only. It does not
cover:

- data/raw/*.csv, and the files derived from them (data/*.json, db/seed.sql,
  fixtures/*.json). These are open data published by Koto, Suginami, Shinjuku,
  Meguro and Taito wards via the Tokyo Open Data Catalog, licensed under
  Creative Commons Attribution (CC BY). See README.md for the sources.
- design/, which is an export from a design tool (including the generated
  runtime design/support.js) and is kept for reference only.
